    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f392df216ceae598b63bb132",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过去累积的努力化成强风促使我前进。\\n所以是顺风喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9db972413fd533b784a9c1c9d5958f5a2ea20010106c60eebf593000e2d9306c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "933"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89a40c4391d99158678430be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我为了追求煦煦和风而出去散步。\\n却好像不小心被误会成失踪了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18cc9330a4121d9bdb975da3a455955880515f43ff498a180e333afaadc3df7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "934"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82726f21feb190b594cb07c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是平时的训练跟森林浴，\\n还有每天都喝牛奶吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ade109e7f552f8c73afdbf10d1b64cb3569dcb680820b85b8be94f17e8733e45",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "935"
      ]
    },
    {
