    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71d7ad88a4dc6e82c6fe64fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "聚集了这么多的烈风，看来是免不了\\n演变成尘卷风了。我会谨慎应对的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bb6bb47f96e0e1dfcb82f89f5aa7df218fc482053b94aca49d0d636b41bf8f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "938"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19f69d032f3262dc7a412ec5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "风会根据每个不同的当下有不同的风向，\\n自由不受束缚，随风自在而吹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17384b1d71cd55215fff83a1e3432e40c15b0afbeea19fab765dd2f655a9c9da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "939"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c05f14b979640f56db8666e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "早晨会喝红茶提振精神喔。热水与砂糖的\\n比例为1:1的特调红茶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56ce64e7b9821c518a7c412d2d05cdf5a1cdbb045b093525b5246f9c8930edc1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "94"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcbac58b690419496535b806",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "聚集了这么多的烈风，看来是免不了\\n演变成尘卷风了。我会谨慎应对的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bb6bb47f96e0e1dfcb82f89f5aa7df218fc482053b94aca49d0d636b41bf8f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "940"
