    {
      "uid": "zhcn:314cbf52d62a1b87c689ade6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "该怎么说呢，虽然可能称不上自信，\\n但我付出了比旁人多一倍的努力喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d2899f0ba97e9188decf1c7a9ca77f0454e70967d20c13889c23c10c40ccb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "942"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7266a2c7e073792a7c586390",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是所有人啰。\\n大家都有着努力不懈后的锐利眼神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af1340067b307d3da92bb36a1186969bbe3e4058602d393e80884235774a365e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "943"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9844375797c90700a287d443",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大概是不慌、不忙，一边享受日光，\\n一边观察四周吧。",
